  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Africa#s Steel Decarbonization</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Focusing on the steel sector, the project catalyzes the industrial decarbonization in South Africa through developing policy frameworks and supporting the shift to near-zero emission steel production. The project will be submitted to the Mitigation Action Facility (MAF) for funding of 25 M EUR. This is a competitive call and the submission will be in collaboration with the consulting firm, Guidehouse Germany GmbH, as well as with the local partners being the DBSA and the IDC.</narrative>
  </description>
